  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "願榮光歸香港 Guān Îng-kng Kui Hiong/Hiang-káng"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<b>原作詞：t, 眾連登仔</b><br />\n<b>作曲：thomas dgx yhl</b><br />\n<b>編曲：t, bp, clk</b><br />\n<b>台語歌詞：芝蘭三堡</b><br />\n<b>台語歌詞校訂：陳豐惠</b><br />\n<b>演唱：董事長樂團<br />\n<br />\n</b><br />\n<br />\n<br />\n啥事這土地目屎流？<br />\nSiánn-sū tse thóo-tē ba̍k-sái lâu?<br />\n奈何咱眾人攏悲恨？<br />\nNāi-hô lán tsìng-lâng lóng pi-hūn?<br />\n城門攑起頭，列邦聲喧透，<br />\nSiânn-mn̂g gia̍h-khí thâu, lia̍t-pang siann suan thàu,<br />\n望自由歸佇咱兜。<br />\nBāng tsū-iû kui tī lán-tau.<br />\n<br />\n啥事這驚惶趕袂走？<br />\nSiánn-sū tse kiann-hiânn kuánn bē/buē tsáu?<br />\n怎樣為信念攏無退後？<br />\nTsuánn-iūnn uī sìn-liām lóng bô thè/thuè-āu?<br />\n雖罔血咧流，前進聲愈響透。<br />\nSui-bóng hueh teh lâu, tsiân-tsìn siann jú hiáng thàu.<br />\n守民主光照香港！<br />\nSiú bîn-tsú kng tsiò Hiong/Hiang-káng!<br />\n<br />\n佇星辰墜落絕望暗暝，<br />\nTī tshenn/tshinn-sîn tuī-lo̍h tsua̍t-bōng àm-mê/mî,<br />\n雺霧中，遠遠遐傳來哨角聲：<br />\nBông-bū tiong, hn̄g-hn̄g hia thuân-lâi sàu-kak siann :<br />\n「為自由！同齊來出聲！<br />\n“Uī tsū-iû! Tâng-tsê lâi tshut-siann!<br />\n全力來拍拚！<br />\nTsuân-li̍k lâi phah-piànn!<br />\n勇氣、智慧，永遠無煞！」<br />\nIóng-khì, tì-huī, íng-uán bô suah!”<br />\n<br />\n黎明來到，欲光復咱香港。<br />\nLê-bîng lâi-kàu, beh kong-ho̍k lán Hiong/Hiang-káng.<br />\n眾人兒女，為正義時代革命，<br />\nTsìng-lâng jî-lú, uī tsìng-gī sî-tāi kik-bīng,<br />\n懇求民主佮自由，萬世久長流，<br />\nKhún-kiû bîn-tsú kap tsū-iû, bān-sè kú-tn̂g lâu,<br />\n我願榮光歸香港。<br />\nGuá guān îng-kng kui Hiong/Hiang-káng.<br />\n<br />\n懇求民主佮自由，萬世久長流，<br />\nKhún-kiû bîn-tsú kap tsū-iû, bān-sè kú-tn̂g lâu,<br />\n我願榮光歸香港。<br />\nGuá guān îng-kng kui Hiong/Hiang-káng.<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eks-50_IY98\" width=\"560\"></iframe><br />\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b><br /></b></span>\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b><br /></b></span>\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>#做伙來唸詩&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</b></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報307期，2019年10月出刊。</b></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"></span><br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
